cks\n\n- **Exercise decoded inputs.**\n  Reader tests cover normalization boundaries and decoded Markdown titles alongside shell-decoded preset-list values.\n\n## Test Plan\n\n| Test | Description | Coverage | Pass |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| T1 | Shared-reader normalization and decoded-input adapter tests | AC2 | [✓](https://github.com/m2ux/prosiform/blob/engineering/artifacts/planning/2026-11-06-662-i10-e07-w01-one-reader-interprets-tag/validation.md#focused-reader-checks) |\n| T2 | Configured make check: static checks, source/harness tests, corpus, installed-wheel smoke and contract checks | | [✓](https://github.com/m2ux/prosiform/blob/engineering/artifacts/planning/2026-11-06-662-i10-e07-w01-one-reader-interprets-tag/validation.md#full-deterministic-check) |\n\n## References\n\n- **R1.** [Validation record](https://github.com/m2ux/prosiform/tree/engineering/artifacts/planning/2026-11-06-662-i10-e07-w01-one-reader-interprets-tag) — the exact tested revision, coverage correction and verification evidence.\n- **R2.** [Preset-selection contract](https://github.com/m2ux/prosiform/blob/c67cf78f020923c4e5bd25d95497ced206be7161/artifacts/planning/2026-10-17-prosiform-v1/design.md#presets) — the decoded-list interpretation and destination-local matching rules.\n","created_at":"2026-11-06T10:39:01Z","updated_at":"2026-11-06T10:42:06Z","closed_at":"2026-11-06T10:42:06Z","merged_at":"2026-11-06T10:42:06Z","merge_commit_sha":"b0ec538dacc97ca546ad5d5d83748764f511e258","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m2ux/prosiform/pulls/665/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m2ux/prosiform/pulls/665/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m2ux/prosiform/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m2ux/prosiform/issues/665/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m2ux/prosiform/statuses/27a